# Measurements taken on the Jetson Orin land here (VLAGUARD_EVIDENCE_OUT in
# deploy/compose/docker-compose.orin.yml). Git ignores them, so a measurement
# never modifies a tracked file and the checkout the manifests read stays
# clean. Copy reviewed files to the desktop, move them to deploy/evidence/<topology>/
# and commit them there (docs/RUNBOOK-orin-hil.md).
*
!.gitignore
